          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "অতিরিক্ত (ôtiriktô) is Sanskrit atirikta, left over as a surplus (Monier-Williams): more than is needed, extra or too much."
            }
          ]
        },
